  (177, 1626, 'Professional work with every type of natural lash, in all the popular techniques.'),
  (178, 1626, 'Over 1,000 lash extension procedures performed with silk, synthetic and natural fibers, for eyes of every shape.'),
  (179, 1626, 'Professionalism backed by courses, diplomas and certificates.'),
  (180, 1626, 'Participation in international conferences and masterclasses.'),
  (181, 1626, 'An individual approach to every client, creating a relaxed and comfortable atmosphere.'),
